WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:09.145
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other.

2
00:00:09.146 --> 00:00:13.079
"China?" they said together.

3
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.169
Samir looked at them with great interest.

4
00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:21.773
"Tell me the secret of that trick you just did," he said.

5
00:00:21.774 --> 00:00:25.805
"We don't know," Vinnie admitted.

6
00:00:25.806 --> 00:00:30.116
"Ah, you do not wish to tell me?" Samir asked.

7
00:00:30.117 --> 00:00:35.201
"No, we really don't know," said Mandy.

8
00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:40.210
Samir laughed loudly.

9
00:00:40.211 --> 00:00:43.546
"Well, see me if you ever need a job.

10
00:00:43.547 --> 00:00:48.623
That trick could make me—I mean you—a lot of money."

11
00:00:48.624 --> 00:00:53.462
Samir walked behind a curtain at the back of the stage.

12
00:00:53.463 --> 00:00:57.468
"Look at that!" said Mandy.

13
00:00:57.469 --> 00:01:02.006
She could see a group of houses outside a nearby gate.

14
00:01:02.007 --> 00:01:06.294
"I count four buildings," said Vinnie.

15
00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:11.221
"Is it a little village?" asked Mandy.

16
00:01:11.222 --> 00:01:16.689
"Village?" said a laughing voice below them.

17
00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:20.280
The children looked down and saw a girl.

18
00:01:20.281 --> 00:01:25.269
"That is Master Yuan's courtyard house," the girl said.

19
00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.275
"Wealthy people live in such homes."

20
00:01:28.276 --> 00:01:31.735
She looked a bit older than Vinnie.

21
00:01:31.736 --> 00:01:36.045
Vinnie and Mandy jumped down from the stage.

22
00:01:36.046 --> 00:01:39.708
"You're new to Chang'an," she remarked.

23
00:01:39.709 --> 00:01:42.534
"Everyone knows Master Yuan.

24
00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:45.405
You must be with the visiting performers.

25
00:01:45.406 --> 00:01:48.806
The acrobats are my favorite."

26
00:01:48.807 --> 00:01:52.279
"Acrobats?" said Vinnie.

27
00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.416
The girl led them through a noisy crowd of performers.

28
00:01:56.417 --> 00:02:00.601
Jugglers were lifting umbrellas with their feet.

29
00:02:00.602 --> 00:02:04.220
"There they are!" cried Vinnie.

30
00:02:04.221 --> 00:02:09.433
Young girls were jumping and flipping in the air.

31
00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:13.747
"What's your name?" Mandy said to the girl.

32
00:02:13.748 --> 00:02:17.488
"I'm Mei-Li," the girl replied.

33
00:02:17.489 --> 00:02:19.837
"My parents are bakers.

34
00:02:19.838 --> 00:02:24.086
They made two hundred buns for Master Yuan's celebration."

35
00:02:24.087 --> 00:02:28.268
Mandy introduced herself and pointed to Vinnie.

36
00:02:28.269 --> 00:02:32.281
"And he's my brother Vinnie," she said.

37
00:02:32.282 --> 00:02:35.205
"What's the celebration for?"

38
00:02:35.206 --> 00:02:44.356
"Master Yuan's son Jinying has passed the first level of the imperial exams," explained Mei-Li.

39
00:02:44.357 --> 00:02:48.002
"What are they?" asked Mandy.

40
00:02:48.003 --> 00:02:50.535
"They are very difficult tests.

41
00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:57.562
There are three levels of exams, and each level is harder than the one before," said Mei-Li.

42
00:02:57.563 --> 00:03:02.087
"If all levels are passed, the person becomes a mandarin.

43
00:03:02.088 --> 00:03:06.001
A mandarin is a very respected official."

44
00:03:06.002 --> 00:03:09.878
"That's a lot of work," said Mandy.

45
00:03:09.879 --> 00:03:11.662
Mei-Li nodded.

46
00:03:11.663 --> 00:03:14.272
"It takes many years of study."

47
00:03:14.273 --> 00:03:17.944
Vinnie rejoined his sister and Mei-Li.

48
00:03:17.945 --> 00:03:22.819
They walked past two monkeys dressed in red costumes.

49
00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:26.748
The children giggled.

50
00:03:26.749 --> 00:03:30.414
"I have to go to the market," said Mei-Li.

51
00:03:30.415 --> 00:03:32.347
"It was nice meeting you."

52
00:03:32.348 --> 00:03:35.810
"Can we come with you?" asked Vinnie.

53
00:03:35.811 --> 00:03:38.134
"Sure," said Mei-Li.

54
00:03:38.135 --> 00:03:41.348
They walked toward a large gate.

55
00:03:41.349 --> 00:03:47.614
Then Mandy noticed a monkey trainer beating one of the two monkeys.

56
00:03:47.615 --> 00:03:52.139
"That's not right!" Mandy thought to herself.

57
00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:57.546
She marched over to the trainer as Vinnie and Mei-Li walked on.

58
00:03:57.547 --> 00:04:02.212
"You shouldn't hurt your animals," said Mandy.

59
00:04:02.213 --> 00:04:06.274
"Mind your own business!" yelled the trainer.

60
00:04:06.275 --> 00:04:11.068
He put the monkey in a cage and walked off.

61
00:04:11.069 --> 00:04:17.014
Vinnie and Mei-Li were already out of sight, walking toward the market.

62
00:04:17.015 --> 00:04:22.602
"Poor thing," said Mandy, as she walked over to the cage.

63
00:04:22.603 --> 00:04:26.548
"Don't worry, I'll save you."

64
00:04:26.549 --> 00:04:29.484
Mandy opened the cage.

65
00:04:29.485 --> 00:04:34.213
The monkey jumped out and ran across the square.

66
00:04:34.214 --> 00:04:43.000
"Wait! Come back!" Mandy shouted.
